            <div xml:id="m-221b562a-f314-497f-8e0e-671e558d919b">
              <lg xml:id="m-67dd038d-6b71-4589-b151-b7e814e22b5b">
                <l xml:id="m-7316c6ef-a66f-463b-8591-2e071f17f5b1" facs="#m-a621025e-8272-4628-9843-2f04c0540cc1" label="text-like">Magnincat. I. D, D, Da, 1, 8, gr, a, a", as, and 6. F or C. 213</l><l xml:id="m-03ec813b-57fa-4c92-8a01-f1c2052613a0" facs="#m-270cac89-6fd7-42a8-a0de-c6a8252707ed" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancte.</l><l xml:id="m-bdb81cb0-66f4-41e9-b6df-fc86e43ef2be" facs="#m-51785ea5-fece-427f-afe8-4324e68ebb81" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, *et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-e91a1620-ac49-4c14-bfdd-5fa7f7903628" facs="#m-4190eee8-299b-49c7-b55b-7da95254562c" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2097d33b-909f-49d2-8484-4eac859410be" facs="#m-12522b48-3fee-4ea6-a659-dd3f6bdf0636" label="text-like">The Solemn Tones</l><l xml:id="m-1fc68bf6-cf27-4e26-b5e5-c8e6d852b6c2" facs="#m-df696697-b2c5-4e49-b2ca-fc1a3c43e1cb" label="text-like">For use on Principal Feasts (ist and and Class).</l><l xml:id="m-6bd5a41b-567e-4e67-b715-2b50a35edd8f" facs="#m-28a78ac5-d08d-4410-8914-bf77d3ae61c0" label="text-like">Tone 1. D, D, Dr, f, g, gr, a, a, ai, and Tone 6. F or C.</l><l xml:id="m-8390bcdd-c670-4aa2-9afc-fb3f8cb8bb86" facs="#m-1025252c-dafa-41da-8fb3-544ef7f1f074" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent with 3 preparatory</l><l xml:id="m-b7d701fe-bdb3-4ec1-9e18-78b409454a77" facs="#m-fb47a0f1-a5ef-460a-b413-fab564d26dc5" label="text-like">Endings of1 accent with a prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d237394-17a1-4965-8c9f-0cffbac181e0" facs="#m-95fd0588-5190-41e9-b793-7e474b48fafe" label="text-like">syllables (and an extra note in anticipation</l><l xml:id="m-090167bf-591a-415c-8187-bbeba770034e" facs="#m-8f8510ae-7934-432c-8499-d7d66ba9e8fb" label="text-like">tory syllables. (For the ending De, an</l><l xml:id="m-75784dcc-1b55-4be3-8bbf-37364600b0b6" facs="#m-90bf4a91-3e07-45be-9f63-7526a4e19aec" label="text-like">of the accent in dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-87efe08f-5c5b-4209-821a-fbf6f96c21c1" facs="#m-8b3b7df6-5d6a-44aa-9661-56808c1a1829" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation ot</l><l xml:id="m-c526485e-c074-4ade-b796-31e6c651ac58" facs="#m-fb917d23-1129-4c01-96cb-07aca537ca71" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences.)</l><l xml:id="m-931955aa-8e01-462f-80fd-6c48b4889302" facs="#m-e98bbfa0-0d2a-41cd-9a83-74a60ab0558f" label="ambiguous">Tone 1.</l><l xml:id="m-4068375b-51f2-4b69-b057-df3724d779da" facs="#m-1934a53a-1245-40ed-8c51-abcab9363630" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-1a207985-1c27-49ab-8f8d-cef05da3705c" facs="#m-8958dabc-51ec-4645-a3b8-fa966c807224" label="ambiguous">4</l><l xml:id="m-939c5da2-24d3-48a0-9bd9-188c7d76ce9c" facs="#m-ff2c4653-e114-424c-8b35-f6aa8d1b8907" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-8248c970-64f5-43b8-a914-9f5389e9cc0f" facs="#m-9bebc7c1-3d60-48e2-a3d4-4c4ff2ec654e" label="lyrics-like">1. Magní-fi-cat"</l><l xml:id="m-9063414b-361b-4c64-8ff2-0a0a32c26d6a" facs="#m-bedfea8f-f80f-4050-9025-22e2faae7d99" label="lyrics-like">ánima mé-a Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1a51491d-99ca-4f78-ac6e-61b55cdb9700" facs="#m-17b9d516-7cbd-4a80-9d9b-f69834d63378" label="lyrics-like">2. Et exsultávit spi¬us mé-us*in Dé-o sa-lu- tá-ri mé¬ C.</l><l xml:id="m-6726959d-7f3b-4254-8e4c-945617d42719" facs="#m-a2fad491-3baa-44cb-b905-f68dd15370c5" label="text-like">And so for all the verses.</l><l xml:id="m-07c3facf-5e63-47c7-9c3b-4dfb5ae1320a" facs="#m-45435277-ef08-462f-b5d8-6a7463cff0ca" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-27e9116b-24ce-4a8b-b183-d51532f68259" facs="#m-cb1d9b49-440e-41f5-a727-3e132423819f" label="ambiguous">— Da</l><l xml:id="m-1a7e2137-fdfe-485a-ac46-047ea6f49c7b" facs="#m-83baaba4-f7e3-45a6-85aa-3459b31b677c" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-7195e96a-bfab-466c-9bb6-7afccd787738" facs="#m-c9f23d83-d093-4301-af64-b54119c767da" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8a3ca9e5-e05c-4382-8d93-b65452688aaf" facs="#m-3f302265-d370-4150-89b7-5855cd9c7ce6" label="lyrics-like